  "title": "Elegear Black Cooling Blanket – Arc-Chill 3.0, Q-Max>0.5, Multi-Size Options",
  "handle": "elegear-black-cooling-blanket-arc-chill-3-0-q-max-0-5-multi-size-options",
  "description": "<h4 data-section-id=\"1gcfk46\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"32\">Award-Winning Cooling Comfort</h4>\n<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"371\">Recognized by <strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"100\">Good Housekeeping’s Bedding Awards (2025 &amp; 2026)</strong>, the Elegear Cooling Blanket is designed for hot sleepers who struggle with night sweats and overheating. Powered by advanced Arc-Chill 3.0 technology (Q-Max &gt; 0.5), it quickly draws heat away from the body to deliver an instant cooling sensation and more restful sleep.</p>\n<h4 data-section-id=\"1w5umzh\" data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"407\">Dual-Sided Reversible Design</h4>\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"660\">One side features high-performance Arc-Chill cooling fabric for immediate cool-to-the-touch comfort, while the other side uses soft, breathable Egyptian cotton for natural everyday coziness. Perfect for adapting to changing temperatures across seasons.</p>\n<h4 data-section-id=\"tra6mx\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"691\">Lightweight &amp; Versatile</h4>\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"845\">Soft, breathable, and easy to carry, this blanket is ideal for bed, sofa, office naps, travel, camping, and flights—comfort wherever you go without bulk.</p>\n<h4 data-section-id=\"13b1gxt\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"874\">Easy Care &amp; Daily Use</h4>\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"1001\">Durable stitching and machine-washable fabric make it simple to maintain while staying soft and long-lasting for everyday use.</p>\n<h4 data-section-id=\"1b4hia\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1030\">Practical Gift Choice</h4>\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1179\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">A thoughtful, award-winning gift for anyone who struggles with heat, night sweats, or restless sleep—combining real comfort with proven recognition.</p>",
